{
  "_readme": [
    "The symbol inventory of each fixture, written out by hand from the fixture",
    "source. This file is the exit criterion for Sprint 1b: parse.py must reach",
    "at least 95% recall against `symbols` on every fixture.",
    "",
    "`excluded_by_design` is the other half of the contract, and the reason this",
    "file is not just a snapshot of what the parser happens to emit: these names",
    "appear in the fixture source and must NOT be indexed. Without them, recall",
    "could be driven to 100% by emitting every identifier in the file.",
    "",
    "Update this file only when the fixture source changes, or when a deliberate",
    "decision about what counts as a symbol changes -- never to make a red test",
    "green."
  ],

  "sample_python.py": {
    "language": "python",
    "symbols": {
      "DEFAULT_TIMEOUT": "constant",
      "MAX_RETRIES": "constant",
      "_INTERNAL_SENTINEL": "constant",
      "SCHEMA_VERSION": "constant",
      "Config": "class",
